Ice Quake is a science fiction, action, thriller film directed by Paul Ziller.

3
00:16:03,529 --> 00:16:09,529
As the permafrost melts in Alaska, underground rivers of volatile liquid
methane form which sets off a series of devastating earthquakes.

4
